<title>SWEDEN: TABLE-Swedish 6-mo T-bill average rate 4.38 pct.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Swedish 6-mo T-bill average rate 4.38 pct.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The average rate in an auction of five billion crowns of six-month Treasury bills was 4.38 percent, Sweden's National Debt Office said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>					     190 day bill</p>
<p> Volume issued (billion Skr)	   5.00</p>
<p> Total bids (billion Skr)		9.37</p>
<p> Number of accepted bids		   27</p>
<p> Number of bids				41</p>
<p> Lowest rate (pct)			 4.37</p>
<p> Highest accepted rate		   4.39</p>
<p> Weighted average rate		   4.38</p>
<p> Percent served at highest rate	70.0</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700-1017</p>
